@ProductApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5135

### List all products
GET {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Search and sort products
GET {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?search=keyboard&sortBy=price&sortDirection=asc
Accept: application/json

###

### Get one product
GET {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a product
POST {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "A compact wireless keyboard",
  "price": 89.99,
  "stock": 12
}

###

### Update a product
PUT {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "price": 79.99,
  "stock": 10
}

###

### Delete a product
DELETE {{ProductApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
